# Exam track — Theme: Gesond Liewen — Sub-lesson 1: Vocabulary
# Sproochentest oral-exam topic. Target level ~B1 (authoring guideline only).
#
# These are Sergii's and his wife's real answers, gathered by interview — do not
# "improve" or genericize them in a later editing pass. The point is that the
# learner rehearses what they will actually say in the Sproochentest.
#
# This file owns FOOD and DRINK. Sub-lesson 2 owns sport, movement and sleep;
# sub-lesson 3 owns illness, childhood and the opinion block. A later file must
# never re-teach a word taught here.
#
# LOD corrections applied: Tasse -> Taass, backen -> baken, Bioprodukt (not
# Bioprodukte), Vitaminn (not Vitamin). "Buchweizen" and "Bir" (pear) have no
# LOD entry and were dropped from the recipe / fruit answers rather than
# guessed; "Dampuewen" is a compound (bare LOD miss, Uewen + Damp both verified).
# "Nëss" is not an LOD-verifiable plural of Noss (the spellchecker suggests
# unrelated words), so the nut sentence stays with the verified singular.

@lesson G1.01 "Healthy Living Vocabulary"

@word d'Gesondheet = the health
@word d'Liewen = the life
@word d'Ernärung = the diet
@word d'Uebst = the fruit
@word d'Geméis = the vegetables
