@sentence
@lu Fir mech heescht Gesondheet gutt iessen a gutt schlofen.
@en For me health means eating well and sleeping well.
@distractor-lu schlecht
@distractor-lu Alkohol
@distractor-en badly
@distractor-en alcohol

@sentence
@lu Ech iessen all Dag Uebst a Geméis.
@en Every day I eat fruit and vegetables.
@distractor-lu Fleesch
@distractor-lu seelen
@distractor-en meat
@distractor-en rarely

@sentence
@lu Ech iesse gär Äppel a Kiischten.
@en I like eating apples and cherries.
@distractor-lu Chipsen
@distractor-lu ni
@distractor-en crisps
@distractor-en never

@sentence
@lu Meng Fra an ech kache mat engem Dampuewen.
@en My wife and I cook with a steam oven.
@distractor-lu Mikrowell
@distractor-lu Restaurant
@distractor-en microwave
@distractor-en restaurant

@sentence
